</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now that the choice is mine,</l><l>Lord, I still choose You;</l><l>’Though the paths be not marked,</l><l>I’m still trusting in You.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>And if the way is hard,</l><l>If things don’t go my way,</l><l>Keep my heart soft to You,</l><l>Keep me open to You.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Dearest Lord, I pray,</l><l>Lead me everyday;</l><l>Don’t let things come between,</l><l>Keep my eyes fixed on You.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>When many years have gone,</l><l>And many things have passed,</l><l>I will still be for You,</l><l>I will still say to You:</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
